Third-party notices for ferrofin-server
=======================================

ferrofin-server is Ferrofin's own code, under GPL-3.0-only (see the copyright
file beside this one), built together with the Rust standard library (MIT OR
Apache-2.0) and the third-party Rust crates and C libraries below, which keep
their own licenses. Each section that follows is one license text and the
crates it covers. The C libraries are compiled from the -sys crates that
carry them: AWS-LC (aws-lc-sys), jemalloc (tikv-jemalloc-sys), libjpeg-turbo
(turbojpeg-sys), libwebp (libwebp-sys) and SQLite (libsqlite3-sys; public
domain).

This software is based in part on the work of the Independent JPEG Group.

A crate that ships no license file of its own is listed under the license's
standard text, with its authors as its crate manifest names them.

